# F19 reproducer: a matmul inner-dimension mismatch inside grad panics the process (compatible matmul shapes: ShapeMismatch) instead of raising a clean error; checked by scripts/run-probes.
W = param[8, 8];
x = reshape(range(8), [1, 8]);
h = linear(16, 5, 1);
print("grad", grad(reduce_add(apply(h, matmul(x, W))), W))
